{"content":[{"c":["JETHER"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Firstborn son of Gideon who, because of his youth, was afraid to execute the Midianite kings Zebah and Zalmunna at his father’s request (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.8.20","r":"Judg.8.20","rawR":"Judg.8.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.8.20","value":"Judg.8.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 8:20"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Ishmaelite and the father of Amasa (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.2.5,32","r":"1Kgs.2.5,32","rawR":"1Kgs.2.5,32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.2.5,32","value":"1Kgs.2.5,32"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 2:5, 32"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.17","r":"1Chr.2.17","rawR":"1Chr.2.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.17","value":"1Chr.2.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:17"},"). He is alternately called Ithra in ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.17.25","r":"2Sam.17.25","rawR":"2Sam.17.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.17.25","value":"2Sam.17.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Samuel 17:25"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Ithra_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Ithra_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Ithra_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Ithra"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Firstborn son of Jada, the brother of Jonathan, and a descendant of Judah through Hezron’s line. He fathered no children (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.32","r":"1Chr.2.32","rawR":"1Chr.2.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.32","value":"1Chr.2.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:32"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Judahite and the firstborn of Ezrah’s four sons (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.17","r":"1Chr.4.17","rawR":"1Chr.4.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.17","value":"1Chr.4.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:17"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Asherite, the father of three sons (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.38","r":"1Chr.7.38","rawR":"1Chr.7.38","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.38","value":"1Chr.7.38"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:38"},") and probably identical with Ithran, Zophah’s son, in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.37","r":"1Chr.7.37","rawR":"1Chr.7.37","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.37","value":"1Chr.7.37"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 7:37"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jether","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jgs 8:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.8.20","rawQueryValue":"Judg.8.20","sourceRefExact":"Judg.8.20"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 2:5, 32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.2.5,32","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.2.5,32","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.2.5,32"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.17"},{"anchorText":"2 Samuel 17:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.17.25","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.17.25","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.17.25"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.32","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.32","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.32"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 4:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.4.17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.4.17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.4.17"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:38","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.38","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.38","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.38"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 7:37","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.37","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.37","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.37"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"7dd557b5ebdd7acb289b305242917a12c331922711ac4d6b0e60aef626da25b6","sourceItemName":"Jether","sourceItemOrder":228,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml